  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="2edfb5a6-2a2d-4b15-aba3-7fcdc835192b"><problem><para>
      <para>This graph represents Andre’s distance from his bicycle as he walks in a park.</para>
      <para><figure><media alt="Graph of Andre’s distance from his bicycle, coordinate plane, origin &lt;span class="><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/2c0bfc03af451e800041ae81edee70d7127bd687"/></media></figure></para>
      <para>Decide whether the following statements are true or false.</para>
      <para>The graph has multiple horizontal intercepts.</para>
      </para></problem><solution><para>True</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is True. </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
